From: ATK/VXE mouse driver
Subject: [PATCH] Add ATK/VXE mouse driver

Adds support for ATK and VXE mice using the ATK HID protocol.
Protocol reverse engineered from ATK HUB v3.x app.asar.

Supports all variants: wired, 2.4GHz dongle, Nearlink (NK).
NK mice use identical protocol — only capability flags differ.

Signed-off-by: <your name>
